description	"TIE-Interceptor

^8Attributes:
- 1 Reinforcement
- 4 Medium rate of fire lasers
- High speed
- High turn speed
- Low shielding

FIGURE DEFINITIONS

Figure 1: This is the armor/health bar. 
Figure 2: This is the turbo boost status bar. 
Figure 3: This is the throttle bar.
Figure 4: This is the shield bar. 
Figure 5: This is the ammo bar. 
Figure 6: This is the link fire indicator.
Figure 7: This is the ship class indicator. 
Figure 8: This is the radar. 
Figure 9: This is the lock on indicator.
Figure 10: This is the aim assist/shot leading indicator."
